    "catalog:note": "Wall-hung urinal, a hood open at the front: back panel, two cheeks, top, bowl floor and front lip. bottom 0.35, rim 0.60. The plan draws the bowl as a half circle inside the box outline; the body is a box hood, since a half cylinder does not mirror.",
